                  <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink mb-2 text-sm">Remember</h3>
                  <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">You don't need to feel "bad enough" to go to therapy. On the contrary: getting support before things get too difficult leads to faster and deeper change.</p>
